## 🔨 What I'm Building

**Vedieco** — A POS and marketplace platform for pop-up vendors. Think digital farmers market: customers find vendors, vendors manage sales, organizers run events. Built with SwiftUI, FastAPI, PostgreSQL, and real-time features. This is the big one.

**CasingCafe** — A corporate wellness and meal ordering platform. Employees sign in with their company email to order meals from the on-site chef — day specials, meal preps, healthy wraps, the works. Also connects people with workout plans and training resources. Built around the idea that your coworkers already want to eat better and train harder, they just need it to be easy.

**Schedulify** — An AI-powered planning tool. Because I got tired of planning things manually.

**Various side projects** — Food tracking apps, portfolio sites, automation scripts, and whatever else I get curious about on a weekend.

